{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地股市繼續尋底。</p><p></p><p>四大指數跌幅約百分之1.5至4。上證綜合指數失守3,700點關口。深圳創業板指數連跌第九日，並以全日低位收市。滬深京三市成交，近1.55萬億元人民幣。創新藥概念股受壓，銀行股則逆市上升。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:22:53.353761+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T10:10:36.212822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:17:54.386738+00:00","content_hash":"c55f3905647df9df74db23e1659756abff7b7a11b9efe3e5d89c0c6b3bb130df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}